            <title>[LU-20449] replay-single test_89: Client umount hangs when OST is offline after file deletion during MDS recovery</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20449</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for S Buisson &amp;lt;sbuisson@ddn.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/5373e7b0-60fc-42e4-9233-ea9ee88d0a29" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/5373e7b0-60fc-42e4-9233-ea9ee88d0a29&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;test_89 failed with the following error:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;Timeout occurred after 2085 minutes, last suite running was replay-single
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test session details:&lt;br/&gt;
clients: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-master/4733" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-master/4733&lt;/a&gt; - 4.18.0-553.125.1.el8_10.x86_64&lt;br/&gt;
servers: &lt;a href="https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-master/4733" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-master/4733&lt;/a&gt; - 4.18.0-553.125.1.el8_lustre.x86_64&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;During  replay-single test_89 , the Lustre client hangs indefinitely when trying to umount the filesystem. The hang occurs while attempting to delete a LOV object for a file that was deleted (via  rm ) after an MDS failover while OST0000 remains offline. The LOV layer blocks waiting for the offline OST to respond, preventing umount from completing. The umount process remains in uninterruptible sleep (D state) for 1228+ seconds until the test framework times out.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="preformattedContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt;&amp;gt; Trace :
task:umount          state:D stack:0     pid:419169
Call Trace:
 __schedule+0x2aa/0x660
 schedule+0x27/0xa0
 lov_delete_raid0.isra.0+0x18b/0x320 [lov]          ← STUCK HERE
 lov_delete_composite+0x17d/0x330 [lov]
 lov_object_delete+0x7a/0x280 [lov]
 lu_object_free.isra.0+0xa3/0x1d0 [obdclass]
 cl_inode_fini+0x7d/0x260 [lustre]
 ll_clear_inode+0x272/0x740 [lustre]
 ll_delete_inode+0x44/0x160 [lustre]
 evict+0x118/0x2a0
 evict_inodes+0x19c/0x240
 generic_shutdown_super+0x42/0x100
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;






&lt;p&gt;VVVVVVV DO NOT REMOVE LINES BELOW, Added by Maloo for auto-association VVVVVVV&lt;br/&gt;
replay-single test_89 - Timeout occurred after 2085 minutes, last suite running was replay-single&lt;/p&gt;</description>
